	* zino/Makefile, zino/bgp.tcl, zino/status.tcl:
	Add checking of certain events related to external BGP:

	 o If a peer reset the connection, flag an event
	 o If a session has been turned off, flag an event
	 o If a peer is down, and the monitored system's uptime is > 10 min,
	   flag an event.

	Internal sessions will not cause any events -- monitoring of an
