2006-05-12  Havard Eidnes  <he@uninett.no>

	* traffic/db/update-dbs.pl:
	Add code to detect and close entries which can no longer be found
	after the scan of monitored devices.  This inspects the logging file
	names to extract the poll-device name, and that device must have
	responded to snmp for the closing to be done.  Devices which are
	no longer monitored will have their corresponding entries closed.

