2001-03-30  Havard Eidnes  <he@uninett.no>

	* traffic/cgi/load-map.pl:
	Implement absolute and relative map references, via the attribute name
	"mapref".  Absolute references start with http://, and should contain
	the map name; the date spec, type and sample-type will be passed on.
	Relative references just contain the map name, and should thus be
	accessible on the same server.  If you want to, you can also
	optionally add an "alt" to the reference, via the "mapalt" attribute.

